            <ArticleTitle>[Ovarian cysts in the differential diagnosis of acute and recurrent abdominal pains].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>493-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors review the differential diagnosis in the acute and recurrent abdominal pain and the classification of ovarian cysts in prepuberal girls. They report the description of three cases of ovarian cysts in prepuberal girls and the role of ultrasonography in their diagnosis in a paediatric department.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
